  "station11: walking floor at r 26.20 m instead of the exterior's nominal floor_radius 26.52 m: at 26.52 a flat floor would be only 1.8 m wide; at 26.20 it is 2.48 m wide with 2.93 m headroom on the centreline and a 0.5 m subfloor for ballast water (constant RF in layouts_gravity.py)",
